{
    "background_story": "Doll was an antique porcelain figurine, crafted with precision and beauty. She sat perched on a shelf in a quaint antique shop, watching as people came and went. Despite the hustle and bustle around her, Doll remained unmoved, her expression serene and unchanging. As children pointed and giggled, as collectors haggled over prices, Doll stood steadfast, her glassy eyes fixed on some distant point. Even when the shop was closed and the lights were dimmed, Doll remained upright, a testament to the craftsmanship that had created her. Her unmoved demeanor was both captivating and unnerving, as if she held secrets and stories that she would never reveal. As the years passed, Doll became a fixture in the shop, a constant presence in an ever-changing world.",
